      "title_en": "Taking a taxi",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["上", "个", "星期", "，", "我", "在", "北京", "玩", "。", "有", "一", "天", "下雨", "了", "，", "我", "就", "打车", "去", "饭店", "。"],
        ["开车", "的", "人", "问", "：", "“", "去", "哪儿", "？", "”", "我", "说", "：", "“", "去", "西边", "的", "一", "个", "饭店", "。", "”"],
        ["路上", "车", "很", "多", "，", "我们", "走", "了", "一", "个", "小时", "。"],
        ["到", "了", "饭店", "，", "我", "想", "起来", "：", "我", "的", "包", "在", "车", "后边", "！"],
        ["我", "马上", "给", "他", "打", "电话", "，", "他", "就", "回来", "了", "。", "我", "说", "：", "“", "太", "谢谢", "你", "了", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Last week I was in Beijing. One day it rained, so I took a taxi to a restaurant.",
        "The driver asked: “Where to?” I said: “A restaurant on the west side.”",
        "There was lots of traffic, and the journey took an hour.",
        "When I got to the restaurant, I remembered: my bag was in the back of the car!",
        "I rang him straight away, and he came back. I said: “Thank you so much!”"
      ],
